// Copy this file to `Secrets.xcconfig` (same folder) and paste your key.
// `Secrets.xcconfig` is gitignored, so the key never enters version control
// (PRD SEC-01 / decision D-05).
//
//   cp MacroLog/Config/Secrets.example.xcconfig MacroLog/Config/Secrets.xcconfig
//
// Then set your Anthropic API key below (no quotes):

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY =
